WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 055. A SMART HOME ACTION NEEDS AN ACCOUNTABLE STORY.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
DECLARE TRIGGER, ACTION, AUTHORITY, LIMITS, AFFECTED OCCUPANTS, AND SAFE DEFAULT.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
RECORD BEFORE, CHANGE, REASON, AFTER, AUTHORIZATION, CONSEQUENCE, AND UNCERTAINTY.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CONFLICT OR OUTAGE SHOULD PAUSE ACTION, EXPOSE THE BLOCKER, AND ENABLE ROLLBACK.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
THIS SIMULATION CONNECTS TO NO DEVICES OR SENSORS AND PROVES NO BENEFIT.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
MAKE EVERY ACTION REVERSIBLE, EXPLAINABLE, OVERRIDABLE, AND RECOVERABLE.
